Olymparch maskinvareplan

  Maskin     bærbar · Example Computers Book 14 IA
  Prosessor  12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-1260P (GenuineIntel)
  Grafikk    0000:00:02.0 8086:46a6 (i915, hoved)

Regler som passer
  gpu-intel                  Intel-grafikk: Vulkan og videoavspilling
                               packages: vulkan-intel lib32-vulkan-intel intel-media-driver
  gpu-intel-vpl              Intel-grafikk: videokoding (oneVPL)
                               packages: vpl-gpu-rt
  ucode-intel                Mikrokode for Intel-prosessor
                               packages: intel-ucode
  audio-sof                  Intel SOF-lyd: fastvare og topologi
                               packages: sof-firmware
  laptop-power               Bærbar: strømprofiler og skjermlysstyrke
                               packages: power-profiles-daemon brightnessctl
  laptop-thermald            Intel-bærbar: varmestyring (thermald)
                               packages: thermald
                               services: thermald.service
  laptop-keyboard-initramfs  Innebygd tastatur ved diskpassordet
                               initramfs-modules: i2c_hid_acpi i2c_designware_platform intel_lpss_pci pinctrl_tigerlake
  wifi                       Wi-Fi: regelverksdatabase og verktøy
                               packages: wireless-regdb iw
  bluetooth                  Bluetooth
                               packages: bluez bluez-utils
                               services: bluetooth.service

Fastvare
  linux-firmware-intel       for i915 iwlwifi

Installeres (14)
  vulkan-intel lib32-vulkan-intel intel-media-driver vpl-gpu-rt intel-ucode sof-firmware
  power-profiles-daemon brightnessctl thermald wireless-regdb iw bluez bluez-utils
  linux-firmware-intel

Oppsett
  /etc/mkinitcpio.conf.d/20-olymparch-hw.conf
    MODULES+=(i2c_hid_acpi i2c_designware_platform intel_lpss_pci pinctrl_tigerlake)

